      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: swing high",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：使用一致规则标记摆动高点与低点"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of labelling swing highs and swing lows with consistent rules using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
